sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Builder as Builder App
    participant File as JSON File
    participant Executor as Executor App
    participant ZIP as ZIP Archive
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard App

    User->>Builder: Create Process
    Builder->>Builder: Design Steps
    Builder->>Builder: Configure Validation
    Builder->>Builder: Add Dependencies
    Builder->>File: Export JSON
    Note over File: process-definition.json

    User->>File: Upload to Executor
    File->>Executor: Load Process
    Executor->>Executor: Validate Schema
    Executor->>User: Display Steps

    loop For Each Step
        User->>Executor: Provide Input
        Executor->>Executor: Validate Input
        Executor->>Executor: Check Dependencies
        Executor->>User: Show Progress
    end

    Executor->>ZIP: Package Results
    Note over ZIP: process-results.zip<br/>- data.json<br/>- metadata.json<br/>- uploads/

    User->>ZIP: Download Results
    User->>Dashboard: Upload ZIP
    ZIP->>Dashboard: Extract Files
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Parse Data
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Calculate Statistics
    Dashboard->>User: Display Analytics
    Dashboard->>User: Show Charts
    Dashboard->>User: Export CSV
